      "exercise": "131",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) 是。代入得 $2x+3y=0>-1$，$x^2+y^2=0\\leqslant2$。\nb) 是。代入得 $2x+3y=-\\frac{1}{2}>-1$，$x^2+y^2=\\frac{5}{4}\\leqslant2$。\nc) 否。虽然 $x^2+y^2=2$，但 $2x+3y=-1$，不满足严格不等式 $2x+3y>-1$。\nd) 是。代入得 $2x+3y=\\frac{11}{3}>-1$，$x^2+y^2=\\frac{10}{9}\\leqslant2$。一个数对必须同时满足两个不等式，才是不等式组的解。",
